  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设$(b_n)$是等比数列. 我们写出这个数列的前$n$项：\n$b_1$，\n$b_2$，\n$b_3$，\n…，$b_{n-1}$，$b_n$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "设$(b_n)$是等比数列. 我们写出这个数列的前$n$项：$b_1$，$b_2$，$b_3$，…，$b_{n-1}$，$b_n$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们用$S_n$表示前$n$项的和：\n$S_n=b_1+b_2+b_3+\\cdots+b_{n-1}+b_n$. (1)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们用$S_n$表示前$n$项的和：$S_n=b_1+b_2+b_3+\\cdots+b_{n-1}+b_n$.　(1)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果$q=1$，那么数列所有的项都等于$b_1$，而$S_n=nb_1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果$q=1$，那么数列所有的项都等于$b_1$，而$S_n=nb_1$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来看$q\\ne1$的情形.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们来看$q\\ne1$的情形.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将等式(1)的两边乘以$q$，得到：\n$qS_n=b_1q+b_2q+b_3q+\\cdots+b_{n-1}q+b_nq$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "将等式(1)的两边乘以$q$，得到：$qS_n=b_1q+b_2q+b_3q+\\cdots+b_{n-1}q+b_nq$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "但$b_1q=b_2$，$b_2q=b_3$，$b_3q=b_4$，…，$b_{n-1}q=b_n$，因此$qS_n=b_2+b_3+b_4+\\cdots+b_n+b_nq$. (2)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "但$b_1q=b_2$，$b_2q=b_3$，$b_3q=b_4$，…，$b_{n-1}q=b_n$，因此$qS_n=b_2+b_3+b_4+\\cdots+b_n+b_nq$.　(2)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从等式(2)逐项减去等式(1)，得到：\n$qS_n-S_n=b_nq-b_1$，\n$S_n(q-1)=b_nq-b_1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "从等式(2)逐项减去等式(1)，得到：$qS_n-S_n=b_nq-b_1$，$S_n(q-1)=b_nq-b_1$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$q\\ne1$，所以$S_n=\\frac{b_nq-b_1}{q-1}$. (I)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为$q\\ne1$，所以$S_n=\\frac{b_nq-b_1}{q-1}$.　(I)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 求下列等比数列$(b_n)$前10项的和：1，2，4，8，….",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "例　求下列等比数列$(b_n)$前10项的和：1，2，4，8，….",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "数列的第1项等于1，而公比等于2. 求出这个数列的第10项：\n$b_{10}=1\\times2^{10-1}=2^9$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 103,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0110#12",
        "p0111#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "数列的第1项等于1，而公比等于2. 求出这个数列的第10项：$b_{10}=1\\times2^{10-1}=2^9$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在利用公式(I)，得：\n$S_{10}=\\frac{2^9\\cdot2-1}{2-1}=2^{10}-1=1024-1=1023$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 104,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "现在利用公式(I)，得：$S_{10}=\\frac{2^9\\cdot2-1}{2-1}=2^{10}-1=1024-1=1023$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将等比数列前$n$项的和的公式写成另一种形式，有时比较便于使用. 我们将式$b_1\\cdot q^{n-1}$代入公式$S_n=\\frac{b_nq-b_1}{q-1}$($q\\ne1$)中替换$b_n$，得到：\n$S_n=\\frac{b_1(q^n-1)}{q-1}$($q\\ne1$). (II)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 104,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "将等比数列前$n$项的和的公式写成另一种形式，有时比较便于使用. 我们将式$b_1\\cdot q^{n-1}$代入公式$S_n=\\frac{b_nq-b_1}{q-1}$($q\\ne1$)中替换$b_n$，得到：$S_n=\\frac{b_1(q^n-1)}{q-1}$($q\\ne1$).　(II)",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在公式(II)中，公比不等于1的等比数列前$n$项的和用数列的第1项、公比与求和的项数表示.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 104,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0111#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "在公式(II)中，公比不等于1的等比数列前$n$项的和用数列的第1项、公比与求和的项数表示.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
